class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>“<span class=\"color-value\"></span>E<span class=\"color-value\"></span>p<span class=\"color-value\"></span>=<span class=\"color-value\"></span>m<span class=\"color-value\"></span>g<span class=\"color-value\"></span>h<span class=\"color-value\"></span>”<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>这<span class=\"color-value\"></span>条<span class=\"color-value\"></span>定<span class=\"color-value\"></span>律<span class=\"color-value\"></span>同<span class=\"color-value\"></span>样<span class=\"color-value\"></span>适<span class=\"color-value\"></span>用<span class=\"color-value\"></span>于<span class=\"color-value\"></span>社<span class=\"color-value\"></span>会<span class=\"color-value\"></span>结<span class=\"color-value\"></span>构<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 190806</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wurenjiedao\"><img alt=\"wurenjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/600px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/900px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>威尔森先生的专利出让合同已经延期了三天。<br />今天是最后的签字日。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……按照约定，我们会在合同签订后立刻将威尔森先生转移至总部。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>但现在的情况……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"503601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"503601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6d/HeadIconSmall-503601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-503601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">示威者：</div><div>抵制天价药！！！还我救命钱！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"611601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"611601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/56/HeadIconSmall-611601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-611601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警察：</div><div>退开！退开！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>暴乱的群众将威尔森医药公司的大楼团团围住，只等他的轿车开出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>合同生效后，铜代谢障碍症的唯一特效药物就会从1美元变为550美元。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这对双方来说，都是最后的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>您好，诸位是圣洛夫基金会的成员吗？我们是威尔森公司的员工。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>请你们和我们一起去签字现场，维持秩序。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>根据威尔森先生和你们签订的附加条约，基金会需协助威尔森医药公司的财产转移。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>请理解，我们也是依据合约行事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……我明白了，我来协助你们。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>只有你吗，小姐？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>合同上并未规定人数。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>司辰有更重要的任务，这项义务由身为助手的我代为履行即可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>当然，我们信任圣洛夫基金会的实力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">男性职员：</div><div>请和我来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不用担心，司辰。我会根据实际情况，决定是否启动紧急预案，保护威尔森先生的人身安全。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>请你和X先生在这段时间做好转移准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗和威尔森医药公司的人离开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一切都如X所料，预言家却并未到场。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>而在无人问津的小巷里，废弃的高楼之上，却有人影在风中孑立。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_7_at_xyishi\"><img alt=\"1_7_at_xyishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png/600px-Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png/900px-Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b0/Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png/1200px-Cg-1_7_at_xyishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“若有一种智慧，能理解这世上所有令自然焕发勃勃生机的力……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“以及一切构成自然的元素事物与它们的当下状态……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“且这种智慧足够庞大，以至于能将这一切数据用于分析……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“那么大到宇宙中最庞大的物体，小到粒子中最微小的一种，所有运动都将被它囊括在同一条公式之中……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>“对这种智慧来说，没有什么是含糊不定的。未来，也只会像过去般出现在它眼前。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>风簌簌吹拂着书页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>……多么优美的论述啊，拉普拉斯先生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>只可惜……有一只蝴蝶已经扇动了翅膀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">X：</div><div>你们在搭建完美大厦时，可曾想过齿轮也有意志？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"wurenjiedao\"><img alt=\"wurenjiedao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/600px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/900px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/Cg-wurenjiedao.png/1200px-Cg-wurenjiedao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人们聚集在威尔森医药公司的楼下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他们的愤怒越来越高。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>抵制天价药！抵制威尔森！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/4b/HeadIconSmall-505501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">警卫：</div><div>该死，我拦不住他们……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……请让我来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗深呼一口气。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>愿和平与我们同在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然后，她高举手臂——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"302301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"302301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c3/HeadIconSmall-302301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-302301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>畅通无阻！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个最基础、安全、无害的神秘术。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为道路施加祝福，以供威尔森的轿车可以不顾人潮的阻碍，安全驶出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>车灯亮起。人们只看到，威尔森的轿车冲了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威尔森：</div><div>烦死了，你们懂什么……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威尔森：</div><div>去伦敦要钱，研发药物要钱，躲避“暴雨”要钱，东山再起要钱，做什么都需要钱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威尔森：</div><div>既然“暴雨”注定会洗刷一切，那坚守道德又有何意义？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"615501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"615501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/90/HeadIconSmall-615501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-615501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"126\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">威尔森：</div><div>让开！贱民！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>威尔森不顾一切地冲了出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……！？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>烟土散去。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>人群已经自觉退开了一大圈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>威尔森的黑色轿车还停在那里，冒着青烟，像被踩扁的易拉罐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它的突进被一起意外事故阻止了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>……上帝啊……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>威尔森死了！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>被自己公司的招牌掉下来砸死了！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">人群：</div><div>这是您的旨意吗！？上帝啊！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>……怎么会这样……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>或许是一瞬的错觉。<br />不远处的废弃高楼顶部，传来了神秘术的波动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但再看过去时，那里已经空无一人。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "TWG-06"}}